inkling2-mlx: Inkling 2 Mini support for MLX-VLM

This repository is MLX-VLM (https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm, MIT License, see LICENSE), pinned at commit
25ead5d2c72f509c03ff570cae2041cbf54fa408, plus three commits by NetProjects (Internet Projects Ltd):

1. mlx_vlm/models/inkling2_loop/ and the DSpark drafter changes: support for Thinking Machines' looped Inkling 2 Mini
   (model_type "inkling2_loop"). mlx_vlm/models/inkling2_loop/language.py is adapted for MLX from the Inkling2Loop
   implementation in Hugging Face Transformers (Copyright 2026 the HuggingFace Team, Apache License 2.0, see
   LICENSE-APACHE-2.0); the other new files are released under the same Apache License 2.0.
2. mlx_vlm/utils.py: read per-tensor formats from hf_quant_config.json for mixed ModelOpt NVFP4 / MXFP8 checkpoints.
3. mlx_vlm/tools/parsers/inkling.py: the Inkling tool-call parser.

Inkling 2 Mini is a model by Thinking Machines Lab, Inc., released under the Apache License 2.0 together with the
Thinking Machines Model Acceptable Use Policy (https://thinkingmachines.ai/model-acceptable-use-policy/).

mlx_vlm/models/inkling2/fused.py carries Metal kernels from Locals (https://github.com/Generated-Computers/Locals,
locals/inkling.py at commit 0931def8), Copyright 2026 Arip Asadulaev, Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0);
its Python side is adapted to this package's modules and caches.

